msgstr ""
"El bloque propio de este preset, como YAML — el documento que valida el "
"esquema de presets."

#: services/webservice/pages/presets.py:317
msgid "Preset YAML"
msgstr "YAML del preset"

#: services/webservice/pages/presets.py:318
msgid ""
"Only this preset is written; every other preset in the file is kept as it"
